{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24556","headline":"偶吟自慰兼呈梦得 · 白居易","name":"偶吟自慰兼呈梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"且喜同年满七旬，莫嫌衰病莫嫌贫。\n已爲海内有名客，又占世间长命人。\n耳里声闻新将相，眼前失尽故交亲。\n尊荣富寿难兼得，闲坐思量最要身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}